# Implementation Plan: Admin Dashboard Module

This document outlines the architecture for the **Admin Dashboard Module**, delivering a secure, centralized control panel to manage the entire AgriChain platform.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Admin Authentication Strategy:** Our current system uses Wallet-based Authentication. To align with this, I will implement a mechanism where specific wallet addresses can be assigned the `Admin` role in the MongoDB `users` collection. This allows Admins to securely log in with MetaMask just like Farmers and Buyers, but they will be routed to a dedicated Admin Layout with elevated privileges.
>
> **Scope of Implementation:** The prompt describes a massive, enterprise-grade system. To deliver a functional, high-quality version within this session, I will:
> 1. Build the dedicated **Admin Layout** (Sidebar, Topbar).
> 2. Build the **Admin Home Dashboard** (Real-time stat cards fetching aggregate counts from MongoDB).
> 3. Build unified **User & Product Management** pages (Table views with Suspend/Approve mock actions).
> 4. Build the **Smart Contract Status** page (Simulating real-time blockchain health).
> Do you approve of focusing on these core pillars for the initial release?

